# 推理代码（third_party/gpt-sovits-infer）是上游 MIT 源码的子集，入库；它跑起来要的
# 预训练模型、词表大文件、FFmpeg 二进制不入库，由 fetch_tts.py 获取。
# 自家微调音色的两个权重文件也由 fetch_tts.py voice 从 ModelScope 拉；参考音频、
# manifest 与 tts_speakers/ 很小，照常入库。许可见 README.md 的「第三方与许可」。

# 旧的整仓上游 clone（抽出推理代码后不再需要）
GPT-SoVITS/
_fetch_tmp/

# fetch_tts.py assets / voice 落地的大目录
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/pretrained_models/
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/text/G2PWModel/
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/runtime/
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/output/
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_weights_*/
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/SoVITS_weights_*/

# fetch_tts.py dicts：上游放在 git 里、单个就超 0.5 MB 的 8 个文件
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/text/cmudict.rep
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/text/cmudict-fast.rep
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/text/engdict_cache.pickle
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/text/namedict_cache.pickle
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/text/g2pw/polyphonic.pickle
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/text/g2pw/polyphonic-fix.rep
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/text/ja_userdic/
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/Accel/vendor/

__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
upload_files/
file_db.sqlite

# 上游 TTS_Config 每次建管线都会把解析后的权重绝对路径写回这个 yaml
# （TTS_infer_pack/TTS.py:451 _load_configs，缺文件就自己生成），入库只会让工作区常脏
third_party/gpt-sovits-infer/GPT_SoVITS/configs/tts_infer.yaml
